Load a model now instead of on first use

Usage: wally models load [OPTIONS] model

Arguments:
  model                       Model id, alias, hf.co/... ref or URL

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
      --engine, --framework TEXT
                              Pin the inference engine (mlx, llamacpp, onnx,
                              sherpa)
      --category TEXT         Load it as this modality (llm, vlm, stt, tts, vad,
                              embedding, diffusion)
